#-------------
JACK-IN-THE-BOX ZOMBIE
#-------------
Biomes 	      	 - N/A
Spawn Conditions - N/A
Rarity           - 9/10 (10/10 is SUPER RARE)
Tag              - N/A
#-------------
STATS
#-------------
HP 		 - 30
DMG		 - 2.5/3/4 - 30/40/60
RNG		 - 2
SPE		 - 0.15 or 0.3, whichever is faster (I don't know MC code)
#-------------
QUIRKS
#-------------
Loses Jack-in-the-box to Magnet Shroom. Weakness!
Has a lower aggro chance on players, if possible.
Using shears on a Jack-in-the-box Zombie disarms it. <- Just for flavor. Feel free to IGNORE this if you want?
#-------------
ABILITIES
#-------------
At 10 HP or less, throws the box straight up, and once
it hits the ground it explodes and deals damage in the
same radius as a creeper. This destroys blocks.
The Zombie should continue to attack as though it had it's
box stolen after this animation, if possible.
#-------------
